evaluation/pages/w3c-bad/
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Copies of the W3C WAI "Before and After Demonstration" (BAD), used unmodified
as an external gold-standard dataset for measuring detection accuracy. We did
not author these pages; that is the point of including them, since a benchmark
built only from our own fixtures would measure our assumptions rather than our
coverage.

    Source:    https://www.w3.org/WAI/demos/bad/
    Copyright: (c) World Wide Web Consortium
    Terms:     https://www.w3.org/Consortium/Legal/copyright-documents
               https://www.w3.org/Consortium/Legal/ipr-notice#Copyright

See evaluation/README.md for how these pages are scored.

docs/ (published site)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Built with the Just the Docs Jekyll theme, consumed as a remote theme and not
vendored into this repository.

    Source:  https://github.com/just-the-docs/just-the-docs
    License: MIT

docs/_sass/custom/custom.scss overrides colours from the theme's bundled
OneLightJekyll syntax scheme to meet WCAG 2.1 AA contrast. The overridden
values are derived from the theme's own palette; see that file for the
measured ratios.
